ercadolibre-meli-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"MELI 2018 Q4","e":"meli","d":"2019-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Pedro Arnt","x":"And as we continue to move volume away from [Inaudible] and optimize our subsidies and free shipping initiatives, we don't even think that we necessarily we'll have to pass the full cost of the price increase onto users, but only a portion of that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/mercadolibre-meli-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"MELI 2018 Q4","e":"meli","d":"2019-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Pedro Arnt","x":"So this should be a fairly manageable price increase given all the conversations we've had.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/mercadolibre-meli-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"MELI 2019 Q3","e":"meli","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Pedro Arnt","x":"How can we use local teams we have to really facilitate and expedite tariffs and customs processes so it's less of a hassle for people purchasing on the platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/mercadolibre-inc-meli-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"MELI 2019 Q3","e":"meli","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Pedro Arnt","x":"While in Brazil we launched our first consumer credit trust also generating savings and funding that we will be able to pass through our buyers and sellers in the form of lower interest rates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/mercadolibre-inc-meli-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"MELI 2019 Q3","e":"meli","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Osvaldo Gimenez","x":"We continue to believe that after this price increase this will be a hell of a good value proposition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/mercadolibre-inc-meli-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra